    {
     "text": "In this video, we'll set up Job Explorer from scratch, and go all the way to your first list of AI-scored jobs.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-1\\voice\\3e8eb2f06f49e0d8.wav",
     "seconds": 6.7185
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "The first time you open Job Explorer, a short setup walks you through it.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-1\\voice\\f217d2c49402f7c6.wav",
     "seconds": 4.007041666666667
    },
    {
     "text": "It starts by explaining how your information is handled.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-1\\voice\\c690611bc6170f06.wav",
     "seconds": 2.9901666666666666
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Your profile, resumes, and applications stay on your computer, encrypted.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-1\\voice\\18806b637430b02f.wav",
     "seconds": 4.266416666666666
    },
    {
     "text": "There's no account, and nothing is sent to the app's maker.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-1\\voice\\14c62a1b9c87d1b4.wav",
     "seconds": 2.977875
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "When the AI scores a job, only what it needs is sent, like the posting and your skills.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-1\\voice\\e0d1097cd3002fb4.wav",
     "seconds": 5.051208333333333
    },
    {
     "text": "Your name and contact details are removed first.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-1\\voice\\3164d3b34f243fa3.wav",
     "seconds": 3.0137916666666666
    },
    {
     "text": "With local AI, nothing leaves your computer at all.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-1\\voice\\b6caab901e39186b.wav",
     "seconds": 2.954833333333333
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "And Job Explorer never applies for you.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-1\\voice\\c94c9ec316d1b24a.wav",
     "seconds": 2.236291666666667
    },
    {
     "text": "You apply on the employer's own site, then mark the job as applied.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-1\\voice\\92fa034707be1641.wav",
     "seconds": 3.959791666666667
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "You can also choose the app's language here.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-1\\voice\\ccac871845e209a2.wav",
     "seconds": 2.0383333333333336
    },
    {
     "text": "Let's get started.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-1\\voice\\eedf9059a330df93.wav",
     "seconds": 1.12275
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}